    biography: This is authored test metadata using locally recovered rival artwork. The map, events, wallet and paint prices belong only to this UI fixture. Race wins, milestones and bounty begin at zero; no production career progress is imported or invented. Use F6/F7 to compare pages. Stop Play Mode to discard the in-memory test profile.
