    Frontend Test Scenes


    Production frontend with isolated, in-memory test services.

    Authored test map, event markers, rival metadata and paint swatches.


    Original game and recovered artwork

    Electronic Arts / EA Black Box


    Local recovery provenance: Tools/FrontendAssets.

    Preview meshes reference the existing BMW framework prefab without running its gameplay components.


    LAN and online authentication remain unavailable; these scenes do not emulate either service.'
